    <values><field>LongDescription__c</field><value xsi:type="xsd:string">Finds: Bundle required SBQQ__ProductOption__c lines on closed quotes where NetPrice is $0 despite an active PricebookEntry showing a list price.
Why it matters: Required components shipped at $0 — the bundle was sold without billing for parts the customer is receiving. Margin loss baked into every renewal.
Suppress a finding: when the option is intentionally inclusive (bundled in the parent&apos;s price by design).
Disable the detector: only if your bundle pricing intentionally zeroes required components. Most should leave this on.</value></values>
